I reviewed all 72 files of `main...HEAD` (U1 to U3). `mise run test:repo-sync` passes all 11 cases. I also ran a real sync with `environments = ["dev","ci"]` into a scratch consumer, and it wrote 55 of 55 files. The engine's environment handling held up in every case I traced. The one serious finding is the first one: the next `setup:configs` fails in every existing consumer, this repo included, and the planned U6 step 2 hits it. Everything after it is low severity.

